Q: How to make dynamic NSImage icon based on SF Symbol name A: <p>Add to Info.plist <code>UTExportedTypeDeclarations</code> with custom <code>UTType</code> identifier that conforms to <code>com.apple.graphic-icon</code> and use the following code to get <code>NSImage</code> icon:</p>
<pre><code>let utType = UTType(exportedAs: &quot;com.test.icons.key&quot;)
let icon: NSImage = NSWorkspace.shared.icon(for: utType)

let utType2 = UTType(&quot;com.apple.graphic-icon.privacy&quot;)!
let icon2: NSImage = NSWorkspace.shared.icon(for: utType2)
</code></pre>
<p>Info.plist example:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;dict&gt;  
    &lt;key&gt;UTTypeConformsTo&lt;/key&gt;  
    &lt;array&gt;  
        &lt;string&gt;com.apple.graphic-icon&lt;/string&gt;  
    &lt;/array&gt;  
    &lt;key&gt;UTTypeIcons&lt;/key&gt;  
    &lt;dict&gt;  
        &lt;key&gt;ISGraphicIconConfiguration&lt;/key&gt;  
        &lt;dict&gt;  
            &lt;key&gt;ISSymbolName&lt;/key&gt;  
            &lt;string&gt;key.fill&lt;/string&gt;  
            &lt;key&gt;ISSymbolColor&lt;/key&gt;  
            &lt;string&gt;white&lt;/string&gt;  
            &lt;key&gt;ISEnclosureColor&lt;/key&gt;  
            &lt;string&gt;gray&lt;/string&gt;  
        &lt;/dict&gt;  
    &lt;/dict&gt;  
    &lt;key&gt;UTTypeIdentifier&lt;/key&gt;  
    &lt;string&gt;com.test.icons.key&lt;/string&gt;  
&lt;/dict&gt;  
</code></pre>
<p>There are additional keys named <code>ISRenderingMode</code>, <code>ISTypeIdentifier </code> and <code>ISCurrentDevice</code> that can be used.</p>
<p>Accepted values for <code>ISRenderingMode</code> are: automatic, hierarchical, monochrome, multicolor, palette</p>
<p>Accepted values for <code>ISSymbolColor</code> are: Black, White, Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Mint, Teal, Cyan, Blue, Indigo, Purple, Pink, Brown, Gray, or 4 component color separated with comma e.g. &quot;0,0,0,1&quot; with values between 0 and 1</p>
<p>There are custom Apple private UTTypes for which the icon <em>MIGHT</em> be generated automatically with use of following configuration :</p>
<pre><code>    &lt;dict&gt;
      &lt;key&gt;ISGraphicIconConfiguration&lt;/key&gt;
      &lt;dict&gt;
        &lt;key&gt;ISTypeIdentifier&lt;/key&gt;
        &lt;string&gt;com.apple.graphic-icon.search&lt;/string&gt;
      &lt;/dict&gt;
    &lt;/dict&gt;
</code></pre>
